10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MtZtOw-rDbUQ7kNvwGyDCWo&_nc_oc=AdrbDjx1Uw7IWlV_-I0PC_f_XkbfUSQWvP5BRHgTaAXH9ve9Zfx0pn_sm11ffrl_RrM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOnOfcVjpWe5zg6EbHC5DpDEjtqADOKolbQZKU4tkfXsA&oe=6AE205CC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9dtkkELyUfUQ7kNvwGQIjGA&_nc_oc=AdopgTCuWZLC89d0U0K1Z8r7QMiPhvNPpxhQ-W4M6a4FafX2aRLRNpzt2KuyFzoN9ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP7NCEMQmrFnAxImH7bOoODo7cFtDsk8kveEskKQzrnhw&oe=6AE216BC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3iABsatg6o8Q7kNvwGZ349K&_nc_oc=AdpKtd9RPrGv0y3VJiZb7-n-t-SmiGDwDi8iNS2Ot4jc5EkXc9B07u5d42Klgc2237w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqYxWEb5P3qCUIbAN2UPAS-PBy-GdmfVE-SFbIXMxsIA&oe=6AE1F5AB"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore